 "schema": "kalshi_series_facets.v1",
 "notes": "The sealed provider mapping of CONTRACTS_V2 7.14, stage 1 of the deterministic tagger (decision D-S8, ruling R267): a Kalshi series ticker (the part of a ticker before the first dash, ruling R170's key) to the tags.v1 subject facet it carries and, where the ticker itself fixes it, to its structure facet. It WINS OUTRIGHT over the keyword rules for the facets it declares, and a facet it does not declare falls through to them. This map and D2's kalshi_series_subjects.v1.json are two vocabularies with two purposes (ruling R295): that one holds English Wikipedia article titles, compared verbatim against a news item's wiki_links by the linker of 7.6; this one holds tags.v1 facet values, which group markets for the cohort of 18.5. This file never supersedes it.",
